  data: {
    LLM: "Capture cards when you can. Build when you have the capturing card. Be careful about capturing early - your pile becomes available to opponents.\n\nTactics center on builds, especially high-value builds. If you have a monopoly on aces (value 14), build 14s that opponents cannot touch. Time your captures carefully - early capture gives opponents access to your top card.\n\nComplex build strategies: create rival piles (e.g., building 14s vs opponent's 12s). High-value builds are powerful because they're easy to augment. Don't release Q, K, A early if it gives opponent monopoly. Use drifting to signal partner. Consider that capturing a 10 or 2 gives opponents access to valuable cards.",
